s high energy efficiency up to 90% and is certified to 80 PLUS® Gold. In addition, the Toughpower Series is designed to meet the demands of Intel’s new Haswell processors.\nFlat Modular Cables\nLow-profile flat modular cables used in the design enhance airflow as well as improve the thermal performance of the chassis. Flat cables are inherently more flexible, making cable routing easier.\n100% High Quality Japanese 105°C/221°F Capacitors\n100% high quality 105 °C (221 ° F) Japanese made capacitors which greatly improve the durability and offer the highest stability and reliability.\nMassive and Dedicated +12V Output\nToughpower 1500W GOLD is equipped with powerful dual +12V rail, please see the output specification below:\nAC INPUT\nInput Voltage: 100V-240V\nInput Current: 18A-9A\nFrequency: 60Hz-50Hz\nDC OUTPUT\n+3.3V\n+5V\n+12V1\n+12V2\n-12V\n+5Vsb\nMax Output Current\n25A\n25A\n70A\n70A\n0.3A\n3.5A\nMax Output Power\n150W\n1400W\n3.6W\n17.5W\nContinuous Power\n1500W\nProduct Specifications\nP/N\nPS-TPD-1500MPCGUS-1\nModel\nTP-1500AH5CEG\nType\nIntel ATX 12V V2.3 & EPS 12V standards\nForm Factor\nATX\nRGB Fan\nNo\nWatts\n1500W\nMax Output Capacity\n1500W\nPeak Output Capacity\n1550W\nColor\nBlack\nPFC (Power Factor Correction)\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-500 msec\nHold Up Time\n17msec (minimum) @ 75% of maximum load at 100V - 240V AC input.\nInput Current\n18A - 9A\nInput Frequency Range\n60 Hz - 50 Hz\nInput Voltage\n100 Vac- 240 Vac\nOperating Temperture\n0℃ to +40℃\nOperating Humidity\n10% to 90%,non-condensing\nStorage Temperture\n-10 ℃ to +50 ℃\nStorage Humidity\n5% to 95%, non-condensing\nCooling System\n135mm double ball-bearing fan, 1700±10%R.P.M.\nEfficiency\n87-92% efficiency @ 20-100% load\nMTBF\n120,000 hrs minimum\nSafety Approval\nUL/ CB+Baurt mark/ CE/ FCC/ CCC/ GOST certification\nPCI-E 6+2PIN\nPCI-E 6+2pin x 10\nUser Manual\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nDrivers & Software\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nCONTACT\nCustomer Support\nSales Partner Request\nMedia Contact\nSUPPORT\nSubmit A Request\nWarranty Policy\nHow to Find S/N\neRMA Service\nSoftware Downloads\nCOMMUNITY\nJoin TT Mod\nCaseMOD Invitation\nPress Release\nMarketing Materials\n3D Maker\nCOMPANY\nAbout Us\nStore Policy\nWhere to Buy\nLANGUAGE\nUnited States/Canada\nBrazil\nLatam\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTikTok\nTwitter\nTwitch\nDiscord\nReddit\nCountry/region\nUSD\n$ | United States\nCAD\n$ |\nCanada\nUSD\n$ |\nUnited States\nLanguage\nEnglish\nEnglish\nFrançais\n© 2026, Thermaltake USA\nPowered by Shopify\nChoosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\nOpens in a new window.",
